<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Alright, so I actually really like this concept. I'm not particularly familiar with the urban legend this is based off, but I do think that a proper exploration of Page's struggles with adapting to a rapidly-shifting world he can only experience one week at a time lends itself to a compelling character-driven SCP. I'd also be interested in Page's experiences in Foundation custody (I am assuming that they have the backpack at the time of the article's writing).</p>
<p>That said, as cybersqyd mentioned, you don't really have any change laid out in your plan. Thing what do a thing articles don't usually fly so well on the wiki these days.</p>
<p>As of this moment, I'm going to give you a Greenlight, as I think you have a very solid core idea here.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Good luck.</p>

