<p>This is my second SCP article. This one was inspired by the good ol’ Little Misters series.</p>
<p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-1799">SCP-1799</a> was created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1229263); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1229263&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606007831" alt="Roget" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1229263)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/roget" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1229263); return false;">Roget</a></span>.</p>
<p>The image used for this article can be found <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:De_Paashaas,_Bestanddeelnr_901-6049.jpg">here</a> It is licensed under the <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en">Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication</a>.</p>
<p>I want to thank <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5903100); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606007831" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5903100); return false;">Pedagon</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pastarasta1" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2551139); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2551139&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606007831" alt="pastarasta1" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2551139)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pastarasta1" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2551139); return false;">pastarasta1</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5986843); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606007831" alt="Ralliston" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5986843); return false;">Ralliston</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-green-squid-kid" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6099255); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6099255&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606007831" alt="A Green Squid Kid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6099255)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/us